### LOGIN (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auths/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "luffy@vinci.be",
  "password": "Mugiwara0Luffy1@"
}

### LOGIN (user already in db)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auths/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@vinci.be",
  "password": "admin"
}

### LOGIN ERRORS
### 1. Wrong credentials (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auths/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "luffy@vinci.be",
  "password": "zoro"
}

### 2. Invalid email format (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auths/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mugiwara",
  "password": "luffy"
}

### 3. BANNED MEMBER (403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auths/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "banni@vinci.be",
  "password": "banni"
}

### TOKENS
### 1. Protected route without token (403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auths/me

### 2. Protected route with fake token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auths/me
Authorization: Bearer fake.token

### ROLES
